---
source: crates/tribute-front/tests/manifests.rs
expression: "report.join(\"\\n\")"
---
[dependencies]
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:0..0 ``: the manifest has no `[package]` table

[package]
version = "1"
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:1..8 `package`: the `[package]` table has no `name`

[package]
name = 1
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:17..18 `1`: `name` must be a string

[package]
name = "pkg"
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:17..22 `"pkg"`: `pkg` is a path keyword and cannot name a package

[package]
name = "std"
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:17..22 `"std"`: `std` names the standard library, which every package depends on

[package]
name = "Geometry"
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:17..27 `"Geometry"`: `Geometry` is not a package name; it must be a lowercase identifier

[package]
name = "my-app"
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:17..25 `"my-app"`: `my-app` is not a package name; it must be a lowercase identifier

[package
name = "app"
=> /ws/app/tribute.toml:8..8 ``: invalid manifest: unclosed table, expected `]`
